# Ten more, and a pause for the last page (the 506b24d walk stopped at #22).
swipe 0.5 0.3 0.5 0.85 300
wait 400
swipe 0.5 0.3 0.5 0.85 300
wait 400
swipe 0.5 0.3 0.5 0.85 300
wait 400
swipe 0.5 0.3 0.5 0.85 300
wait 400
swipe 0.5 0.3 0.5 0.85 300
